\nその後、程なくして「サイバーダイン社」と記載された心当たりのない小包みが和也の元に送られてきた。その包みの中に入っていたものは、1/6サイズの人形『サイバドール・メイ』。なんと自分の意志で動き、話をする不思議なロボットだった！\n\nここから始まる、和也とメイの物語。『HAND MAID メイ』は、老若男女、個性剥き出しのキャラクター達が次々と登場し、画面狭しと大暴れするドタバタコメディだ！"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k1XbnKx8AXcjaDStLhzpZZQDYo4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k1XbnKx8AXcjaDStLhzpZZQDYo4.jpg","language":"ja","width":660,"height":990},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/HRu6fSIPYfAUePmaxu0nGDFeOD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/HRu6fSIPYfAUePmaxu0nGDFeOD.jpg","language":"ja","width":714,"height":1071},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xkZIMyCKq9Oc35AgHew406R8lth.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xkZIMyCKq9Oc35AgHew406R8lth.jpg","language":"xx","width":1122,"height":1600}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cA6dFqEb1FgX4NXOWZdFKlHU4g2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cA6dFqEb1FgX4NXOWZdFKlHU4g2.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wwiYEgMKrdW0qA1qSjOxUadOrRO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wwiYEgMKrdW0qA1qSjOxUadOrRO.jpg","language":"xx","width":1593,"height":896},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sHx457ZuR5ZDmTWpOOVA9kTgP5E.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sHx457ZuR5ZDmTWpOOVA9kTgP5E.jpg","language":"xx","width":1905,"height":1071},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hLtzLPst8cs0fG1lXAu6lbUSIpq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hLtzLPst8cs0fG1lXAu6lbUSIpq.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k1XbnKx8AXcjaDStLhzpZZQDYo4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cA6dFqEb1FgX4NXOWZdFKlHU4g2.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":0,"name":{"value":"Speciali","language":"it-IT"}